  unitName: Dragon God Ragshelm
  unitId: 30515
  unitNumber: 764
  description: An ancient dragon that turned into a more evil form after receiving
    power from a demon. In exchange for the great power it had received it lost its
    mind, driving it to act upon its hatred of humans alone. As it gradually lost
    itself, the humans that had once faced it appeared anew to challenge the ancient
    dragon once more. However, Ragshelm could feel that the Phoenix Knight sought
    vengeance no more, but instead looked towards the future through the power of
    his sword. Some say that in response to this Ragshelm unleashed all the power
    it possessed.
  summonDesc: I shouldn't...have...woken...<br>My...madness...<br>The people...run...
  fusionDesc: Grr...gruhh...roar...<br>I...destroy...everything...<br>Rooaaar!!!
  evoDesc: Can't you see it...?<br>Can't you...hear it...?<br>I am...already...<br>a...calamity...
